        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUPERVERSE</strong> is a fast-paced, action-packed space shooter that launches you into an ancient network of interconnected universes. Your mission: travel back through space-time and prevent the extinction of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely solely on your instincts, reflexes, speed, devastating weapons, and protective shield as you navigate hostile environments filled with enemy ships, asteroids, explosions, and volatile cosmic particles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1056170/extras/d4606d0daa31cd21b192080ecb0dba5f.poster.avif?t=1789116682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1056170/extras/d4606d0daa31cd21b192080ecb0dba5f.webm?t=1789116682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1056170/extras/d4606d0daa31cd21b192080ecb0dba5f.mp4?t=1789116682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SUPERVERSE you will travel through wormholes and explore new, mysterious worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the game from the perspective of an Artificial Intelligence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face enemy ships and machines that hunt, swarm, and adapt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly your favorite spaceship and master its unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an immersive 3D visual and audio experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op </strong>for up to 4 players</h2>Grab three friends and share the screen — SUPERVERSE is built for couch co-op, with full controller support for every player.<br><br>Friends not on the couch? <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong> lets them join from anywhere, and only you need to own the game.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>SUPERVERSE can be played on <strong>Windows</strong> and <strong>Linux</strong>¹.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUPERVERSE</strong> is a fast-paced, action-packed space shooter that launches you into an ancient network of interconnected universes. Your mission: travel back through space-time and prevent the extinction of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely solely on your instincts, reflexes, speed, devastating weapons, and protective shield as you navigate hostile environments filled with enemy ships, asteroids, explosions, and volatile cosmic particles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1056170/extras/d4606d0daa31cd21b192080ecb0dba5f.poster.avif?t=1789116682\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1056170/extras/d4606d0daa31cd21b192080ecb0dba5f.webm?t=1789116682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1056170/extras/d4606d0daa31cd21b192080ecb0dba5f.mp4?t=1789116682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SUPERVERSE you will travel through wormholes and explore new, mysterious worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the game from the perspective of an Artificial Intelligence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face enemy ships and machines that hunt, swarm, and adapt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly your favorite spaceship and master its unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an immersive 3D visual and audio experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op </strong>for up to 4 players</h2>Grab three friends and share the screen — SUPERVERSE is built for couch co-op, with full controller support for every player.<br><br>Friends not on the couch? <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong> lets them join from anywhere, and only you need to own the game.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>SUPERVERSE can be played on <strong>Windows</strong> and <strong>Linux</strong>¹.</i></p>",
